(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-42","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["罗清知道伤者仍[[susceptible|易受影响]]，送款不能逼他起床。她[[overhear|无意听见]]账房说家属没来便算放弃，立即[[assert|坚持说明]]到门口才算送到。门外孩子的[[chorus|齐声歌唱]]压过远处[[owl|猫头鹰]]叫，今日的赔款单很[[conspicuous|醒目]]，顾衡不用一只[[briefcase|公文包]]藏总数。季禾加一道[[brace|支撑架]]固定担架，车走得[[brisk|轻快]]也不应震动患者。许庭退回的误收费注明原由，是防[[fraud|欺诈]]的一项核查，不是买他日后不受质问的声誉。车队先走远户，不能让近钟楼的人先领完。","首袋钱[[destined|预定送往]]季禾伤友家，[[numerical|数字的]]清单把工资与医费分开。山侧一头[[buck|雄鹿]]穿林，沈砚不追，继续沿旧路核户名。说明写成简单[[prose|文字]]，原本让人看不懂的[[abbreviation|缩写]]展开，让账对家属[[accessible|可理解]]。一处[[address|住址]]已迁，送到旧门虽[[advantageous|方便有利]]，钱却落不到[[alive|活着的]]人手里。两村[[allied|联合的]]送款人问邻居，把名字[[aloud|出声]]念给屋中老人听，不要求他能自己写才认他领款；两名见证与他按印一同留下。","记账[[analyst|核算者]]不是[[angel|天使]]，顾衡要求后来的人再核。他不带[[army|军队]]催人接受，随行[[artist|画师]]只画核好的渠，不画家属流泪。各户能领的[[availability|可用款项]]原数未变，不给签得快的人奖励。院外小孩玩[[badminton|羽毛球]]，一只球落进米筐，满篮真粮不再让他们[[baffle|迷惑]]。罗清取回球，没有拿点心作[[bait|诱饵]]哄家属签结清。门上的[[bar|横木]]被移开，药包从干[[basement|地下储间]]搬出，逐户核准去向，没让一场救济再变成丢物。","旧工队为欠款的[[battle|争斗]]终于得到原票对应的回款。顾峦捡走药箱里的[[beetle|甲虫]]，听外商孩子问棋盘的[[bishop|象]]怎么走，答应送完款再教。孩子一[[bite|口]]饼啃出笑，季禾这名[[blacksmith|铁匠]]却看见伤友的[[bleak|冷清的]]家。罗清只[[bless|祝福]]他的后续日子，不代他说复原已足。那位[[blond|金发的]]外商车夫取出押款回单，将它贴在[[bosom|胸前]]再交还主人，临行[[bow|鞠躬]]。旧义务到手印完成才算领到了，桌前一句愿意并不够。","山脚[[brook|小溪]]旁的家户收到干布，新[[button|纽扣]]已缝好。守粮铁[[cage|笼]]现在只护货，不扣人。补给的[[cake|米饼]]分给路上小孩，沈砚重作[[calculation|计算]]，发现一户多领十文。他不因金额少不记，也不让家属受公示羞辱，私下说明后更正回票。维渠[[capital|资金]]不得从赔款悄扣，许庭请[[captain|船长]]另拿运费。账册无人先作[[censor|删改者]]涂掉不利页，旧[[chain|锁链]]锻成栏件前仍拍印拓样，物件改了用途，已经发生的事不会因此消失。","太阳落下，二十七户款已送，四户迁去盐路，需要再走两天。沈砚写下未达，不在清单上提前划结。他请求许庭两条新航路各带一份寄款，到户回单由当地合作社返送，不让商行同时证明自己发款又收款。盐粮返还已经点清，医馆药费仍有持续照护的一项，在三方留出的专款里按实际支付。罗清把账收好，看见沈砚第一卷欠她的钱还差一小笔，提醒自己欠的也照普通规则还。他点头，将新一筐药根收入先交过去，没让如今的签字资格免去当初的小债。"],"en":["Patients remained [[susceptible|susceptible]]. Luo would [[overhear|overhear]] a clerk treating absence as waiver and [[assert|assert]] that delivery required reaching homes. A children’s [[chorus|chorus]] rose over an [[owl|owl]]. [[conspicuous|Conspicuous]] totals stayed outside a [[briefcase|briefcase]]. Ji added a [[brace|brace]] so [[brisk|brisk]] travel did not jolt patients. Xu’s refunded fees retained reasons and [[fraud|fraud]] checks, buying no future immunity. The team began with distant households.","Funds [[destined|destined]] for Ji’s friend had separate [[numerical|numerical]] wage and care lines. A [[buck|buck]] crossed their path. Simple [[prose|prose]] expanded every [[abbreviation|abbreviation]], making claims [[accessible|accessible]]. One [[address|address]] had changed. Leaving money at the old door was [[advantageous|advantageous]] but useless to those [[alive|alive]]. [[allied|Allied]] village carriers read names [[aloud|aloud]] to an elder who could not write. Witnesses and his thumbprint recorded actual receipt.","An [[analyst|analyst]] was no [[angel|angel]]; Gu required later checks and no [[army|army]] to force acceptance. An [[artist|artist]] drew verified channels, not grief. Fund [[availability|availability]] did not reward quick signatures. A [[badminton|badminton]] shuttle landed in real rice. They need not [[baffle|baffle]] children with an empty rescue promise. Luo returned it and used no sweet [[bait|bait]] for settlement. A door [[bar|bar]] opened, and packets left a dry [[basement|basement]] under recorded destinations.","The workers’ wage [[battle|battle]] finally produced matched receipts. Luan removed a [[beetle|beetle]] while a merchant child asked how a chess [[bishop|bishop]] moved. A [[bite|bite]] of cake made him smile; the [[blacksmith|blacksmith]] saw his friend’s [[bleak|bleak]] home. Luo would [[bless|bless]] future days without declaring recovery sufficient. A [[blond|blond]] driver held a pledge receipt to his [[bosom|bosom]], returned it and gave a [[bow|bow]]. A willingness to pay was not actual delivery.","A [[brook|brook]] household received cloth with a repaired [[button|button]]. The cargo [[cage|cage]] held goods, not people. Children received rice [[cake|cake]]. Shen’s [[calculation|calculation]] found ten extra coins and corrected them privately. Maintenance [[capital|capital]] could not be secretly deducted from damages. Xu’s [[captain|captain]] received separate freight. No [[censor|censor]] erased inconvenient pages. The old [[chain|chain]] was rubbed for evidence before forging: changed use could not erase history.","Twenty-seven households received funds; four had moved two days away. Shen posted incomplete delivery rather than false closure. Xu’s two routes carried separate remittances with cooperative confirmation, preventing self-certified receipt. Returned salt and grain were counted. Continuing medical costs remained funded against actual care. Luo reminded Shen his own earlier clinic debt still had a small balance. He paid fresh herb income under ordinary rules; authority to sign agreements did not exempt a personal debt."]});
